---
description: Release readiness never implies authorization to publish or mutate production.
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not publish packages or images, create or push tags/releases, upload release
assets, deploy, change branch protection/rulesets, rotate credentials, or
modify production settings unless the user explicitly authorizes that exact
side effect.

An instruction to audit, prepare, validate, harden, or make a release READY
authorizes repository changes and read-only verification only. READY is
evidence, not permission to release.
